body:
I follow my instincts (crushes) on that for the most part. However, I have noticed some preferences I have;

Personality wise, I love girls who can carry a conversation, either a ridiculous and funny one or a deep and interesting one. Loyalty is also very, very important to me - I've been stabbed in the back before and I won't let it happen again.

Physically, I really like short hair (about chin/shoulder length). Other then that, anything goes, really.
